    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DCD301 · Chapter 10 · Session 53 · assessment / review</span>\n<h2>Session 53 — Lab 3: CMOS AND Gate design</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14408 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DCD301 · Chương 10 · Buổi 53 · kiểm tra / ôn tập</span>\n<h2>Buổi 53 — Lab 3: CMOS AND Gate design</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14408 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO5, CLO6, CLO7, CLO8</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">TU</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO5, CLO6, CLO7, CLO8</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">TU</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Lab 3: CMOS AND Gate design<br>lab 3.1 Set up the Cadence environment</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>Lab guide, Cedance software</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Perform lab tasks, write report</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Practise in the <a href=\"/exam?course=DCD301\">Exam Room — DCD301</a> (1 practice papers: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Luyện tại <a href=\"/exam?course=DCD301\">Phòng thi — DCD301</a> (1 đề luyện: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>📑 School slides — Lab Procedure (1 slides)</h3>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">matched by content (deck title ↔ session topic). File: Lab_Procedure.pdf</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>📑 Slide của trường — Lab Procedure (1 slide)</h3>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">ghép theo nội dung (tên deck ↔ chủ đề buổi). Tệp: Lab_Procedure.pdf</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/DCD301/flm1/d12/001.webp\" alt=\"DCD301 · Lab Procedure · slide 1: Lab 3: XOR Gate Design Using Cadence Digital Tools - Lab Manual\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"1657\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Lab Procedure · slide 1/1</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Lab 3: XOR Gate Design Using Cadence Digital Tools - Lab Manual<br><br>Objectives<br>- Understand the digital IC design flow using Cadence tools.<br>- Design a 2-input XOR gate at RTL and gate-level.<br>- Perform functional simulation and view waveforms (VCD).<br>- Prepare basic synthesis and P&amp;R scripts for Genus and Innovus.<br>- Produce simple reports (timing/area).<br><br>Files included:<br>- xor_gate.v      (RTL)<br>- tb_xor.v       (Testbench)<br>- xor.sdc       (Timing constraints example)<br>- genus_syn.tcl    (Genus synthesis script)<br>- innovus_pnr.tcl (Innovus P&amp;R script)<br><br>Quick instructions:<br>1) Simulation (Xcelium / NC-Sim):<br>  Compile: xmvlog xor_gate.v tb_xor.v<br>  Elaborate: xmelab tb_xor<br>  Simulate: xmsim tb_xor<br>  Output: dump.vcd (open with GTKWave/EPWave)<br><br>2) Synthesis (Genus):<br>  genus -f genus_syn.tcl<br>  Adjust library paths in the script to point to your standard cell .lib<br><br>3) P&amp;R (Innovus):<br>  innovus -init innovus_pnr.tcl<br>  Adjust LEF/Library read commands in the script to match your environment.<br><br>Notes:<br>- The included scripts are templates. Replace library paths and technology files with your PDK locations.<br>- XOR module is combinational; SDC file is illustrative (commented clocks). For integration into sequential sy</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
